---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About">
  <article class="article">
    <header class="article-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">about</span>
      <h1>About</h1>
    </header>
    <div class="article-body">
      <h2 id="whoami">$whoami</h2>
      <p>Hello.</p>
      <p>I am a software and security enthusiast currently pursuing graduate studies at UMD-College Park. I especially enjoy software development and security.</p>
      <p>I have worked as a software engineer at VMware and Versa Networks. I am also interested in operating systems, low-level programming, pwn, and reverse engineering. Outside computers, I enjoy football, jazz, and funk.</p>
      <p>Feel free to say hello on <a href="https://twitter.com/z3phyrrrrr">Twitter</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
